on":"exasol/administration/","title":"Administra\u00e7\u00e3o","text":"<p>Comandos frequentes de administra\u00e7\u00e3o.</p>"},{"location":"exasol/backup/","title":"Backup &amp; Restore","text":"<p>Procedimentos de backup.</p>"},{"location":"exasol/bucketfs/","title":"BucketFS","text":"<p>Gest\u00e3o de ficheiros no BucketFS.</p>"},{"location":"exasol/dbeaver/","title":"DBeaver","text":"<p>Liga\u00e7\u00e3o e administra\u00e7\u00e3o atrav\u00e9s do DBeaver.</p>"},{"location":"github/","title":"GitHub","text":"<p>Documenta\u00e7\u00e3o GitHub, GitHub Pages e MkDocs.</p>"},{"location":"github/git-basics/","title":"Git B\u00e1sico","text":""},{"location":"github/git-basics/#clone","title":"Clone","text":"<p>```bash git clone URL</p>"},{"location":"github/github-pages/","title":"GitHub Pages","text":"<p># GitHub Pages</p> <p>O GitHub Pages permite publicar sites est\u00e1ticos diretamente a partir de um reposit\u00f3rio GitHub.</p>"},{"location":"github/github/","title":"GitHub","text":"<p>Documenta\u00e7\u00e3o Git e GitHub.</p>"},{"location":"github/mkdocs/","title":"MkDocs","text":"<p>Gerador de documenta\u00e7\u00e3o baseado em Markdown.</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/","title":"Kubernetes","text":"<p>Plataforma de orquestra\u00e7\u00e3o de containers.</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/#objetivos","title":"Objetivos","text":"<ul> <li>Implementar aplica\u00e7\u00f5es</li> <li>Escalar servi\u00e7os</li> <li>Gerir disponibilidade</li> <li>Automatizar opera\u00e7\u00f5es</li> </ul>"},{"location":"kubernetes/#areas","title":"\u00c1reas","text":"<ul> <li>Arquitetura</li> <li>Pods</li> <li>Namespaces</li> <li>Deployments</li> <li>ReplicaSets</li> <li>StatefulSets</li> <li>Services</li> <li>Ingress</li> <li>Volumes</li> <li>Persistent Volumes</li> <li>ConfigMaps</li> <li>Secrets</li> <li>Helm</li> <li>Troubleshooting</li> <li>Labs</li> </ul>"},{"location":"kubernetes/architecture/","title":"Arquitetura Kubernetes","text":""},{"location":"kubernetes/architecture/#componentes-do-control-plane","title":"Componentes do Control Plane","text":"<ul> <li>API Server</li> <li>Scheduler</li> <li>Controller Manager</li> <li>etcd</li> </ul>"},{"location":"kubernetes/architecture/#componentes-worker-node","title":"Componentes Worker Node","text":"<ul> <li>kubelet</li> <li>kube-proxy</li> <li>Container Runtime</li> </ul>"},{"location":"kubernetes/configmaps/","title":"ConfigMaps Configura\u00e7\u00e3o desacoplada da aplica\u00e7\u00e3o.","text":""},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/","title":"Deployments","text":"<p>Deployments gerem Pods de forma declarativa.</p> <p>Permitem:</p> <ul> <li>Escalar aplica\u00e7\u00f5es</li> <li>Atualiza\u00e7\u00f5es controladas</li> <li>Rollback</li> <li>Auto-recupera\u00e7\u00e3o</li> </ul>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#arquitetura","title":"Arquitetura","text":"<pre><code>graph TD\n\nA[Deployment]\n--&gt; B[ReplicaSet]\n\nB --&gt; C[Pod 1]\nB --&gt; D[Pod 2]\nB --&gt; E[Pod 3]</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#listar-deployments","title":"Listar Deployments","text":"<pre><code>kubectl get deployments\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#criar-deployment","title":"Criar Deployment","text":"<pre><code>kubectl create deployment nginx \\\n--image=nginx\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#escalar","title":"Escalar","text":"<pre><code>kubectl scale deployment nginx \\\n--replicas=3\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#atualizar-imagem","title":"Atualizar imagem","text":"<pre><code>kubectl set image deployment/nginx \\\nnginx=nginx:latest\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#historico","title":"Hist\u00f3rico","text":"<pre><code>kubectl rollout history deployment nginx\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#rollback","title":"Rollback","text":"<pre><code>kubectl rollout undo deployment nginx\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#ver-estado","title":"Ver estado","text":"<pre><code>kubectl rollout status deployment nginx\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/deployments/#troubleshooting","title":"Troubleshooting","text":"<p>Ver deployment:</p> <pre><code>kubectl describe deployment nginx\n</code></pre> <p>Ver pods relacionados:</p> <pre><code>kubectl get pods\n</code></pre> <p>Ver eventos:</p> <pre><code>kubectl get events\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/helm/","title":"Helm","text":"<p>Package Manager do Kubernetes.</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/helm/#repositorios","title":"Reposit\u00f3rios","text":"<p>```bash helm repo list</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/ingress/","title":"Ingress Publica\u00e7\u00e3o HTTP e HTTPS. ## Listar ```bash kubectl get ingress","text":""},{"location":"kubernetes/mermaid-test/","title":"Teste Mermaid","text":"<pre><code>graph TD\n\nA[Docker]\n--&gt; B[Kubernetes]\n\nB --&gt; C[Pods]\nB --&gt; D[Services]</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/","title":"Namespaces","text":"<p>Namespaces permitem separar recursos dentro de um cluster Kubernetes.</p> <p>S\u00e3o \u00fateis para:</p> <ul> <li>Produ\u00e7\u00e3o</li> <li>Desenvolvimento</li> <li>Testes</li> <li>Equipas distintas</li> </ul>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/#arquitetura","title":"Arquitetura","text":"<pre><code>graph TD\n\nA[Kubernetes Cluster]\n\nA --&gt; B[namespace-dev]\nA --&gt; C[namespace-test]\nA --&gt; D[namespace-prod]</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/#listar-namespaces","title":"Listar Namespaces","text":"<pre><code>kubectl get namespaces\n</code></pre> <p>ou</p> <pre><code>kubectl get ns\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/#criar-namespace","title":"Criar Namespace","text":"<pre><code>kubectl create namespace dev\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/#apagar-namespace","title":"Apagar Namespace","text":"<pre><code>kubectl delete namespace dev\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/#trabalhar-num-namespace","title":"Trabalhar num Namespace","text":"<pre><code>kubectl get pods -n dev\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/#exemplo","title":"Exemplo","text":"<p>Criar um deployment em dev:</p> <pre><code>kubectl create deployment nginx \\\n--image=nginx \\\n-n dev\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/namespaces/#troubleshooting","title":"Troubleshooting","text":"<p>Ver recursos existentes:</p> <pre><code>kubectl get all -n dev\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/","title":"Pods","text":"<p>Os Pods s\u00e3o a unidade mais pequena execut\u00e1vel no Kubernetes.</p> <p>Um Pod pode conter um ou mais containers que partilham rede e armazenamento.</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/#arquitetura","title":"Arquitetura","text":"<pre><code>graph TD\n\nA[Node] --&gt; B[Pod]\n\nB --&gt; C[Container 1]\nB --&gt; D[Container 2]</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/#listar-pods","title":"Listar Pods","text":"<pre><code>kubectl get pods\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/#ver-detalhes","title":"Ver detalhes","text":"<pre><code>kubectl describe pod POD_NAME\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/#ver-logs","title":"Ver logs","text":"<pre><code>kubectl logs POD_NAME\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/#entrar-no-container","title":"Entrar no container","text":"<pre><code>kubectl exec -it POD_NAME -- bash\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/#exemplo","title":"Exemplo","text":"<p>Criar um Pod nginx:</p> <pre><code>kubectl run nginx --image=nginx\n</code></pre> <p>Verificar:</p> <pre><code>kubectl get pods\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/pods/#troubleshooting","title":"Troubleshooting","text":"<p>Ver eventos:</p> <pre><code>kubectl describe pod POD_NAME\n</code></pre> <p>Ver logs:</p> <pre><code>kubectl logs POD_NAME\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"kubernetes/secrets/","title":"Secrets","text":"<p>Armazenamento seguro de credenciais.</p>"},{"location":"kubernetes/services/","title":"Services Exposi\u00e7\u00e3o de aplica\u00e7\u00f5es. ## Listar ```bash kubectl get svc","text":""},{"location":"linux/","title":"Linux","text":"<p>Documenta\u00e7\u00e3o Linux.</p>"},{"location":"linux/commands/","title":"Comandos \u00dateis","text":""},{"location":"linux/commands/#ver-espaco-em-disco","title":"Ver espa\u00e7o em disco","text":"<p>```bash df -h</p>"},{"location":"linux/scripts/","title":"Shell Scripts","text":"<p># Shell Scripts</p> <p>Exemplos de automa\u00e7\u00e3o Linux.</p>"}]}